      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p>\"<i>Hey now, don't be shocked-meow.</i>\"<br />— Blackcat, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></p></blockquote>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Blackcat <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Characters\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/3/36/Characters.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150527022122\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Characters.png\" data-image-key=\"Characters.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014712\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"BlackcatDialogue\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014712\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014712 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest?cb=20150527014712 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"BlackcatDialogue\" width=\"105\" height=\"87\" data-image-key=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-image-name=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Name</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Blackcat</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"age\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Age</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occup\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Cat</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"firstintroduced\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Introduced In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lastseen\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ongoing</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\nBlackcat is a supporting character/item appear in <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\"><i>Potion Maker</i></a>. He can be seen talking in the <a href=\"/wiki/Tia#Intro_Transcript\" title=\"Tia\">introduction</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\">Tia</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">Personality</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlackcat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>According to <a href=\"/wiki/Pio/dialogues\" title=\"Pio/dialogues\">Pio's dialogue</a>, it is very hard working.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Function\">Function</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBlackcat%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Blackcat automatically adds <a href=\"/wiki/Materials\" title=\"Materials\">materials</a> into cauldron for 1 minute by default (this time limit may affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">events</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Fairy\" title=\"Fairy\">fairy</a>) and will stop if the cauldron is empty (time is not counted when empty). When using a nyan ticket (<span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span title=\"nyan-ticket\"><img alt=\"Nyan-Ticket\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/f/f7/Nyan-Ticket.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/27?cb=20150816175817\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Nyan-Ticket.png\" data-image-key=\"Nyan-Ticket.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>), there is a probability to summon Blackcat. Speed is relatively faster than Pushcat. If pushcat's level is maximized, blackcat is able to collect all materials in the the cauldron, even if material emission is maxed out.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#CC0033\" colspan=\"2\">Items\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#FFC; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Material\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Material\">Material</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">Potion</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup\" title=\"Powerup\">Powerup</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Costume\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Costume\">Costume</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Fairy\" title=\"Fairy\">Fairy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Pushcat\" title=\"Pushcat\">Pushcat</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Blackcat</strong>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261013065612\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 498/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 67/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.592      1 -total\n 64.48%   19.080    